{"date":"2002-09-17","platform":"其他","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/f6/84/96826_IIkZr.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/f6/84/96826_IIkZr.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/f6/84/96826_IIkZr.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/f6/84/96826_IIkZr.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/f6/84/96826_IIkZr.jpg"},"summary":"        怪物城市一个宁静祥和的日子。麦克·华斯基（比利·克里斯托 Billy Crystal 配音），可爱的大眼仔，这个高傲臭屁的独眼小怪物换了一辆超级先进、全自动化的六轮驱动汽车。他抑制不住心中的狂喜，首先邀请他的好伙伴毛怪（约翰·古德曼 John Goodman 配音）参观、搭乘。苏利文在车中毛手毛脚的行为让大眼仔颇为恼火，他禁止毛怪碰触任何按钮，可是自己又显然还没掌握全部的操作要领。结果折腾了半天汽车没有开动，倒霉的大眼仔却三番五次遭遇磨难。原本准备炫耀一番，结果成了丢人现眼…… \r\n　　本片为皮克斯工作室首支有对话并且派生自长片作品的动画短片。","name":"Mike's New Car","name_cn":"迈克的新车","tags":[{"name":"短片","count":38,"total_cont":0},{"name":"pixar","count":25,"total_cont":0},{"name":"欧美","count":24,"total_cont":0},{"name":"2002","count":21,"total_cont":0},{"name":"3D","count":7,"total_cont":0},{"name":"美国","count":6,"total_cont":0},{"name":"怪兽电力公司","count":5,"total_cont":0},{"name":"OVA","count":4,"total_cont":0},{"name":"原创","count":3,"total_cont":0},{"name":"剧场版","count":3,"total_cont":0},{"name":"怪兽车震","count":3,"total_cont":0},{"name":"番外","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"PeteDocter","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"RogerGould","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"动画","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"2002-07","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"皮克斯","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"迪士尼","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"Disney","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"表番","count":1,"total_cont":0}],"infobox":[{"key":"中文名","value":"迈克的新车"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"v":"大眼仔的新车"},{"v":"麦可的新车"},{"v":"怪兽电力公司 番外篇"}]},{"key":"上映年度","value":"2002年9月17日"},{"key":"片长","value":"4分钟"},{"key":"官方网站","value":"https://www.pixar.com/mikes-new-car"},{"key":"其他","value":"《怪兽电力公司》DVD附赠短片"},{"key":"话数","value":"1"},{"key":"制作国家/地区","value":"美国"},{"key":"语言","value":"英语"},{"key":"导演","value":"Pete Docter / Roger Gould"},{"key":"编剧","value":"Pete Do